  "body": "## Summary\nAddresses user feedback on live documentation review:\n1. **Homepage Architecture Preview**:\n   - Refactored the System Architecture Blueprint preview in `docs/index.md` to wrap dark and light previews in separate anchor containers with `class=\"only-dark\"` and `class=\"only-light\"`, matching the proven pattern used for the End-State Topology Summary.\n   - Enhanced `docs/stylesheets/extra.css` with `body:not([data-md-color-scheme=\"slate\"]) .only-dark { display: none !important; }` to guarantee dark assets stay hidden in default light mode.\n   - Aligned `docs/secrets-management.md` with the identical container pattern.\n2. **Archify Architecture Canvas**:\n   - Updated `docs/assets/final-project-end-state.architecture.json` Card 2 item 2 wording to: *\"AWS IAM authenticates the controller; Infisical supplies runtime secrets to Ansible\"*.\n   - Simplified connection label between Infisical and Controller to *\"supplies runtime secrets\"*.\n   - Re-delivered `docs/assets/final-project-end-state.html` with 9/9 showcase checks passing (0 errors, 0 warnings).\n   - Re-generated visual check screenshots for 1440x900 and 2048x1320 viewports in both light and dark themes.\n\n## Verification\n- `mkdocs build --strict`: Passed cleanly with 0 warnings/errors.\n- `yamllint .`: Passed (0 errors).\n- `ansible-lint ansible/playbook.yml`: Passed (0 failures, 0 warnings, production profile).\n- Visual verification: Captured screenshots in both light and dark themes with headless Chrome, confirming theme-based preview card swapping functions without JavaScript.",
